/* Alias context for const-expr leaf resolution. When an imported module's
 * derived const (e.g. SLOTTOTAL = NSLOTS * SLOTCOUNT) is registered with a
 * module alias, its operand names appear bare in the source RHS but are stored
 * in the symbol table qualified ("alias.NSLOTS"). cold_eval_i32_const_expr
 * consults this alias as a fallback so qualified operands resolve. */
static Span ColdConstEvalAlias = {0};

